# Generated by `dump-prompt`, and variants derived from it. Deliberately not committed: the baseline is
# rendered from IdeaAssistPromptBuilder, so a checked-in copy would be a second source of truth that
# drifts from the code the moment the builder changes. Regenerate it instead.
prompts/

# Run artifacts. Provenance lives inside each file (prompt label, model, effort), but they are
# measurements of one moment against one model version, not something to carry forward in the repo.
runs/
